            "review_title": "Review at Hoa Long Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Vu B\n5 contributions\n0\nSuper food, good price\nJan 2017 • Family\nThis is my no. 1 go-to Chinese restaurant whenever i am in Hanoi. Food is delicious and price is incredibly affordable. An average of 250,000 -300,000 VND/ person for restaurant food standard and service is just way worth it. The place is perfect if you are dining in large group or family since a la carte portion is pretty big. They also serve Dimsum for people who prefers something light. Restaurant setting is average, staffs speak little English but if you are up to good Chinese restaurant food with affordable price, this is the place. \nP/S: They have shifted to new address at 10 Nguyen Quyen st, Hai Ba Trung District, Hanoi\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 13, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
