            "review_text": "Monique N\nLondon, United Kingdom137 contributions\n0\nso good and filling\nSep 2016 • Couples\nThis place has 3 floors so if it looks busy still go in and ask for a table. \nThe kitchen is in front of the restaurant which is a little strange but helps you spot the place. \n\nThe food was amazing, we ordered way to much as the dim sum actually arrived larger and in more quantity than the picture menu showed. \n\nThe service was good but the staff speak very little English.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 13, 2016",
